<title>HONG KONG: Trading in Four Seas Merc shrs suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Four Seas Merc shrs suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Four Seas Mercantile Holdings Ltd was suspended at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong Stock Exchange said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Four Seas Mercantile shares closed Friday HK$0.05 lower at HK$4.525.</p>
<p>The company is a snack food and beverages distributor.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6369</p>
</text>
